#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of survivor fireboots.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of fur boots.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of survivor wetsuit boots.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of hiking boots.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of heavy survivor boots.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of leather armor boots.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of light survivor boots.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for pair of armored boots.
