#. ~ Description for scenario 'Ambush' for a male character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour, cold and weary you ducked into a small "
"cabin for the night.  The next morning, you awoke to the sound of lots of "
"movement in the woods."
msgstr ""
"冬の訪れによって襲ってきた寒気と、夜をやり過ごす為に小さな小屋に逃げ込み、疲れ果てた状態で一晩を過ごしました。翌朝、周囲の森から多くの足音が近付いてくるのに気付きました。"

