#. ~ Description for scenario 'Assault on Precinct Z' for a male character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You knew the day was going to be bad when it started with your partner "
"getting eaten by a perp before you even had coffee.  The scene back at the "
"station house looks bad, real bad.  This is going to be an all-nighter."
msgstr ""
"コーヒーを取りに行っている間に相棒が犯人に喰われた時から最低の日だなんて分かりきっていました。それにしたって警察署の前にワラワラと集るゾンビだなんて最悪です、実に最悪の光景です。ははっ、これで今日も徹夜決定だ！"

