msgid "\"So, what is this thing supposed to be, exactly?\""
msgstr "「ええと、一体これは何だ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Uncategorized object seven-seven-three-four.\""
msgstr "「未分類オブジェクト、7-7-3-4」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It came from the other side of one of the apertures.\""
msgstr "「穴の向こう側から来ています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Mommy, help!\""
msgstr "「お母さーん、助けてぇ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're still trying to figure out what makes it tick.\""
msgstr "「こいつがまだ動けるかどうか調べているところだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're not even sure what it is.\""
msgstr "「これは何だ、さっぱりわからん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The cell structure is unlike any we've ever seen.\""
msgstr "「こんな細胞の構造は見たことが無い」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It does seem to have some form of higher level brain functioning.\""
msgstr "「より高度な脳機能を持っているようだな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Problem solving, memory retention, that sort of thing.\""
msgstr "「問題の解決や、記憶の保持、そういったことだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There appear to be some anomalous aspects to the mimicry.\""
msgstr "「変則的な擬態機能があるようですね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Members of the species have some kind of neurocognitive link.\""
msgstr "「この生物は、認知神経をリンクできるようだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"This one's repeating phrases that the previous specimen was exposed to.\""
msgstr "「繰り返している単語は、前回の被験者の言葉ですね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a child shrieking!"
msgstr "[子供の悲鳴]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh God, my leg, Oh God!\""
msgstr "「なんてことだ、脚が...おおぉ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a long cry of agony!"
msgstr "[苦痛に満ちた叫び声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You mean it's not just parroting us?\""
msgstr "「これがただのオウム返しではないと言うのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's parroting us, but we're uncertain as to how or why.\""
msgstr "「確かに言葉を真似ていますが、何故、どんな方法で、ということが分かりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It may be a mechanism for attracting prey.\""
msgstr "「獲物を引き寄せるための機能、という可能性もあります」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It could even be a way of trying to scare us off.\""
msgstr "「もしくは、私たちを追い払おうとしているのかも」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We just don't know.\""
msgstr "「分からないな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "an anguished wail!"
msgstr "[苦悶に満ちた悲鳴]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You're gonna rot in hell for this!\""
msgstr "「地獄に落ちろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You hear me!?\""
msgstr "「聞いているのか！？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You're gonna rot in hell, you pieces of shit!\""
msgstr "「くたばりやがれ、くそったれが！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Like we said, we have no idea what it's thinking.\""
msgstr "「言った通り、何を考えているのかさっぱりだろう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is that glass electrified?\""
msgstr "「あのガラスには電流でも流れているのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Why don't you touch it and find out?\""
msgstr "「触ってみてはどうだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Of course it is.\""
msgstr "「ええ、良いですよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What'll happen if the power goes out?\""
msgstr "「もし停電になったらどうなるんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't worry about it.\""
msgstr "「それについては心配要りませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't worry.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There are seven backup generators.\""
msgstr "「予備発電機を7台用意しています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"And what if all the backups fail?\""
msgstr "「予備もダメになったら？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We'd have to terminate the specimen.\""
msgstr "「試験を中止する必要があるでしょうね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The glass alone won't keep us safe for very long.\""
msgstr "「ガラス1枚だけでずっと安全が保障されるとは思えないな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That fuckin' thing is horrible, man, it gives me the creeps.\""
msgstr "「あぁ畜生、恐ろしいよ、本当に、ゾッとする」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's probably more scared of us than we are of it.\""
msgstr "「きっと我々がアレを恐れる以上に、アレも我々の事を恐れていますよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Somehow, I doubt that.\""
msgstr "「なんだか、信じられないな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, we got other specimens that could withstand a grenade.\""
msgstr "「やあ、手榴弾にも耐える別の検体を捕獲しましたよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"And that's supposed to comfort me?\""
msgstr "「で、それは私を満足させてくれるのかな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"At least we know they can die.\""
msgstr "「少なくともあいつらは殺すことができる」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"U-O Seven-Seven-Three-Four.\""
msgstr "「U-O 7-7-3-4」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Individual instances of U-O Seven-Seven-Three-Four.\""
msgstr "「U-O 7-7-3-4の個別試験」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"To be kept in a standard biohazardous containment chamber.\""
msgstr "「標準的な生物災害用格納施設に保管」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Until such time as more permanent arrangements are made.\""
msgstr "「期間は、より恒久的な事態が発生するまで」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shows a noted preference for human brain tissue.\""
msgstr "「人間の脳組織に対する顕著な反応」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Destroy the specimen if it begins to interact with the lock.\""
msgstr "「施錠部分に接触しようとした場合、速やかに処分すること」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Kill them all and let God sort them out!\""
msgstr "「皆殺しにしろ。仕分けは神に任せろ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I watched a snail crawl along the edge of a straight razor.\""
msgstr "「カタツムリを見ていた。カミソリの刃の上を這っている」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've seen horrors, horrors that you've seen.\""
msgstr "「私は地獄を見た。君が見た地獄を」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I love the smell of napalm in the morning.\""
msgstr "「朝のナパーム弾の臭いは格別だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is the way the fuckin' world ends.\""
msgstr "「これが、この世の終わりだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Look at this fuckin' shit we're in, man.\""
msgstr "「まるで地獄じゃないか」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Every man has got a breaking point.\""
msgstr "「だれにだって限界がある」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'ma cut those fuckin' tentacles off, bitch!\""
msgstr "「その触手を叩き切ってやる、クソが！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Watch you bleed out!\""
msgstr "「黙って死にな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I wonder if it understands us.\""
msgstr "「アレは私たちの事を理解しているんだろうか」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Do you understand what I'm saying?\""
msgstr "「私の言っていることが分かりますか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Look, it's responding!\""
msgstr "「見ろ、返事をした！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That's the first time it moved all morning.\""
msgstr "「午前中ずっと動いていたのは初めてですね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm certain it's trying to understand us.\""
msgstr "「私たちの事を理解しようとしている。きっとそうだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm not convinced it can actually comprehend us.\""
msgstr "「アレが私たちを理解できるとは、到底思えません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's just repeating us.\""
msgstr "「言葉を真似してるぞ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Just being an alien creature doesn't mean it's intelligent.\""
msgstr "「地球外生命体だからといって、知性があるとは限りませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Just because it doesn't look like you doesn't mean that it isn't.\""
msgstr "「しかし、外見が僕らとかけ離れているからといって、知性が無いとは限らない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please open the door and enter the cell.\""
msgstr "「ドアを開けて、部屋に入ってください」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Would it react differently with a child?\""
msgstr "「子供に反応するかな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Experiments to determine extent of cognitive abilities still underway.\""
msgstr "「認知能力の程度を調べる実験が進行中です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Subject has so far displayed a total lack of empathy toward human "
"suffering.\""
msgstr "「これまでの実験によれば、検体は人間の苦しみに対する共感が完全に欠如しています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I got a round trip ticket.\""
msgstr "「往復チケットを買ったよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How's your mom doing?\""
msgstr "「ママは何してる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How's your dad doing?\""
msgstr "「パパは何してる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I love you.\""
msgstr "「愛しているよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "「私も愛してるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Just a little.\""
msgstr "「ほんの少しだけね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Only a few more days 'til the weekend.\""
msgstr "「もうちょっとで週末だよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Do you smoke?\""
msgstr "「煙草は吸うかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You're new here, aren't you?\""
msgstr "「見ない顔だね？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do you like it here?\""
msgstr "「ここは気に入ったかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It won't hurt a bit.\""
msgstr "「全然痛くないよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That was a long time ago.\""
msgstr "「ずいぶん経ったな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Does it scare you?\""
msgstr "「怖がってる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't worry, it can't hurt us.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫、私たちに危害は与えないよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What are you afraid will happen?\""
msgstr "「何を怖がっているの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Anything else?\""
msgstr "「他に何か？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You think they're the same sex?\""
msgstr "「あいつらの性別は皆同じだと思う？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Do they even have sex?\""
msgstr "「そもそも性別があるの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can I see your phone?\""
msgstr "「ちょっと携帯電話見せて？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You got a dollar I can borrow?\""
msgstr "「お金貸してくれない？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you busy at the moment?\""
msgstr "「今忙しい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you busy later?\""
msgstr "「このあと暇？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you busy tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜ひま？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you free tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜空いてる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you going to the party tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜パーティーしない？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you going to help them?\""
msgstr "「あの人たちを助けようとしてるの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you alone?\""
msgstr "「一人ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you hungry?\""
msgstr "「お腹が空いたのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm hungry.\""
msgstr "「腹が減った...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Go ahead.\""
msgstr "「先に行ってて」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have a good time.\""
msgstr "「楽しんできてね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you eaten yet?\""
msgstr "「まだ食べてないの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is it supposed to rain tomorrow?\""
msgstr "「明日は雨かな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Okay.\""
msgstr "「了解だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good.\""
msgstr "「いいね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Great.\""
msgstr "「素晴らしい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fantastic.\""
msgstr "「最高だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"God damn it.\""
msgstr "「ちっ、しまった」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"God damn it!\""
msgstr "「くそっ、しまった！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Damn it.\""
msgstr "「しまった」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Damn it!\""
msgstr "「しまった！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fuck.\""
msgstr "「くそっ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shit.\""
msgstr "「ちくしょう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fuck!\""
msgstr "「くそったれが！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shit!\""
msgstr "「ちくしょう！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fuckin' piece of garbage.\""
msgstr "「くそったれ、このゴミ屑が」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I need a new lab coat.\""
msgstr "「新しい白衣が必要なんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Excellent.\""
msgstr "「素晴らしいな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Excuse me.\""
msgstr "「ちょっとすみません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good morning.\""
msgstr "「おはよう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good afternoon.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good evening.\""
msgstr "「こんばんは」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good night.\""
msgstr "「おやすみ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good luck.\""
msgstr "「幸運を祈るよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can I help you?\""
msgstr "「何か手伝える事は？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you seeing anyone?\""
msgstr "「君...付き合ってる人はいるか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Forget it.\""
msgstr "「気にしないでくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How long were you two together?\""
msgstr "「付き合い始めてどれぐらい経ったかな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Give me a call later.\""
msgstr "「後で電話してくれよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Call me.\""
msgstr "「電話してね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"From time to time.\""
msgstr "「時々な」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We have a serious situation here.\""
msgstr "「ここは深刻な状況だよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Call the police.\""
msgstr "「警察を呼んでくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Call an ambulance.\""
msgstr "「救急車を呼んでくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Get me the White House.\""
msgstr "「ホワイトハウスに連れて行ってくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you feeling all right?\""
msgstr "「具合は大丈夫かい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I think I'll live.\""
msgstr "「何とか生きてはいる...と思うよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I think I need to see a doctor.\""
msgstr "「医者に診て貰う必要がありそうだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is everything all right?\""
msgstr "「何か問題はないかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm okay, don't worry about me.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫だ、問題ない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's just a scratch.\""
msgstr "「こんなのかすり傷さ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've got a headache.\""
msgstr "「頭痛がする」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm fine.\""
msgstr "「平気だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you sure?\""
msgstr "「本当ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Positive.\""
msgstr "「まったくだな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Affirmative.\""
msgstr "「その通りだな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Negative.\""
msgstr "「違うな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Sorry.\""
msgstr "「すまない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Happy Birthday!\""
msgstr "「ハッピーバースデー！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you ever been to California?\""
msgstr "「カリフォルニアに行ったことある？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What time do you get off?\""
msgstr "「いつ出発するんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We should hit up the shooting range later.\""
msgstr "「もっと射程距離を伸ばさないと」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm heading to the pool after work.\""
msgstr "「仕事が終わってプールに行くところだよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have a good trip.\""
msgstr "「良い旅を」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Where did you come from?\""
msgstr "「君はどこから来たんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you been waiting long?\""
msgstr "「大分待ったかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you done this before?\""
msgstr "「前にこれをやった事があるかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hello.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Help!\""
msgstr "「助けて！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Here it is.\""
msgstr "「ここにあるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've got family coming tomorrow.\""
msgstr "「家族が帰ってくる日を待っているんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do I use this?\""
msgstr "「これはどうやって使うんですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do you know?\""
msgstr "「何で分かるんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How long have you been here?\""
msgstr "「どれだけここにいたんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How many languages do you speak?\""
msgstr "「君は何ヶ国語話せるの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How many people?\""
msgstr "「何人いるんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much were these earrings?\""
msgstr "「このイヤリングはいくらしたんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much do I owe you?\""
msgstr "「おいくらですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much will it cost?\""
msgstr "「料金はいくらですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much would you like?\""
msgstr "「値段はいくらが希望なんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How old are you?\""
msgstr "「何歳ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How tall is it?\""
msgstr "「どれくらいするんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How was the movie?\""
msgstr "「映画はどうだった？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How was your trip?\""
msgstr "「旅はどうだった？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How's it going?\""
msgstr "「調子はどうだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"See you later.\""
msgstr "「また後で」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"See you tonight.\""
msgstr "「また今夜ね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I got this weird rash a few days ago.\""
msgstr "「数日前から異様な発疹が出てきたんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Let me have a look at it.\""
msgstr "「ちょっと見せてみてよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"When did you find out?\""
msgstr "「何か見つけたかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Seven o'clock.\""
msgstr "「7時だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Nobody is helping us.\""
msgstr "「誰も助けてくれない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're on our own.\""
msgstr "「自力で頑張ろう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're all alone.\""
msgstr "「人は皆1人ぼっちさ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We should split into groups of two each.\""
msgstr "「二手に分かれよう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It can't follow all of us.\""
msgstr "「これなら追いつかれない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Be careful out there.\""
msgstr "「あたりに注意して」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There you are.\""
msgstr "「さあどうぞ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've been looking all over for you.\""
msgstr "「ずいぶん捜したんだよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's looking for us.\""
msgstr "「私たちを探してるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's faster than us.\""
msgstr "「僕らより素早いね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's looking right at us.\""
msgstr "「こっちを見てるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's heading right for us!\""
msgstr "「こっちに向かってくる！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can you swim?\""
msgstr "「君は泳げるかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't do that.\""
msgstr "「やめてよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You hear that?\""
msgstr "「聞こえたか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Be quiet.\""
msgstr "「静かにしろ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Look out!\""
msgstr "「気をつけろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Run!\""
msgstr "「逃げろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hurry!\""
msgstr "「急げ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No!\""
msgstr "「駄目だ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'll never forget you.\""
msgstr "「決して君を忘れないよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Take his gun, we're going to need it.\""
msgstr "「彼の銃を貰っていこう、きっと役に立つ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do we get out of here?\""
msgstr "「どうやったら脱出できるんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This place is like a maze.\""
msgstr "「まるで迷路だな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh God, I'm the only one left.\""
msgstr "「何てこった、置いてけぼりにされた」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please, I don't want to die.\""
msgstr "「やめて、死にたくない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Mom.\""
msgstr "「母さん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Mom, I miss you.\""
msgstr "「母さん、会えなくて寂しいよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Me go, you stay.\""
msgstr "「ワタシ、イク。キミ、クルナ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please, God.\""
msgstr "「神様、どうか私を許して下さい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a gurgling sound."
msgstr "[水が詰まったようなゴボゴボという音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a choking sound."
msgstr "[苦悶に咽ぶ声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a snapping sound."
msgstr "パチン。"

#. ~ Beeper sound
#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/vehicle_use.cpp
msgid "beep!"
msgstr "ビー！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/mattack_actors.cpp
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "beep-beep-beep!"
msgstr "ビー！ビー！ビー！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "BEEP!"
msgstr "ビーッ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a loud hiss."
msgstr "シューッ。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a loud crackling noise."
msgstr "パチッ。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/ranged.cpp
msgid "bang!"
msgstr "バァン！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a klaxon blaring!"
msgstr "[騒々しいクラクション！]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"EMERGENCY, EMERGENCY!\""
msgstr "「緊急事態発生、緊急事態発生！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a static hissing sound."
msgstr "[連続した摩擦音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "That creepy abandoned post-apocalyptic lab complex looks safe..."
msgstr "「放棄された研究施設は気味が悪いが、安全そうだ...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Don't worry, it isn't like anything could teleport out of the containment "
"cells."
msgstr "「心配する必要はありません。こいつは、格納容器から脱出できるような代物ではありませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"TEKELI-LI!\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"TEKELI-LI!  TEKELI-LI!  TEKELI-LI!\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ！テケリ・リ！テケリ・リ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Tekeli-li.\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a slurping sound."
msgstr "[何かを啜るような音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"WHY!  WHY, WHYYY!\""
msgstr "「何故だ！何故だ、何故だぁぁ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "an electronic voice saying \"CONNECTION FAILED.  Abort, Retry, Fail?\""
msgstr "「セツゾクニシッパイシマシタ。チュウシ、サイシコウ、シッパイ？」という電子音声が聞こえました。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I was once a man.  A MAN!\""
msgstr "「私もかつては人間だった。ニンゲンだったのだ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What have I become?\""
msgstr "「私はどうなる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "an electronic voice saying \"KILL ALL HUMANS!\""
msgstr "「ゼンジンルイヲマッサツスル！」という電子音声が聞こえました。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you seen my children?\""
msgstr "「私の子供達を見なかったか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What have I become?  Why can't I die?\""
msgstr "「私はどうなる？何故死ねないんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Please, kill me!\", followed by an electronic voice saying \"SELF "
"PRESERVATION PROTOCOLS ACTIVATED\""
msgstr "「頼む、私を殺してくれ！」という叫び声の後に「ジコホゾンプロトコルヲサドウシマシタ」という電子音声が聞こえました。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please, take me with you.\""
msgstr "「お願いだ、一緒に連れて行ってくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Not that way!  Go left!\""
msgstr "「そっちじゃない！左に進め！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't make me have ye walk the plank.\""
msgstr "「君を殺したくはない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Welcome to the pirate's cove matey!\""
msgstr "「友よ、海賊の入り江へようこそ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Arr, ahoy there maties!  And welcom- welcom- welcome to tha pirate's "
"cove.\""
msgstr "「おや、おーい君！海賊の入り江にようこそいらっしゃい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's me.\""
msgstr "「私です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"SKREEEEEEEEEEEEEE!\""
msgstr "「キィィィィィィィィィィィィィィイ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dum de dum dum dum.\""
msgstr "「ラン ラ ラン ラン ラン」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ahoy there!\""
msgstr "「おおい、そこの！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"They will know the joy of creation.\""
msgstr "「彼らは創造の歓びを知るだろう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ha huhuhu huh huh.\""
msgstr "「ハッ、フフフッ、フフ、フフッ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Let's eat!\""
msgstr "「食べようぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hello!\""
msgstr "「よう！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hai!\""
msgstr "「へい！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hi!\""
msgstr "「やぁ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Let's play!\""
msgstr "「遊ぼうよ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What's your name little child?\""
msgstr "「可愛い子だね、君のお名前は？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Come closer.\""
msgstr "「もっと近くに来てよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Come play with me!\""
msgstr "「一緒に遊ぼうよ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No running.\""
msgstr "「走るんじゃない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Running is against the rules.\""
msgstr "「走るなんてずるいよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"RAAAAGGGGRRRHHH!\""
msgstr "「ラアァァグララァァァ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"BZZZZZTKKKKKSSSSVVVVVSSTT\""
msgstr "「グズズズズズグググググズズズズヴヴヴヴヴズズググ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"WHIIIRRRCRRIIIIZZZZZZVVVT\""
msgstr "「フィィルルルグルルリリリリギギギギギィィジジジ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Let's rock!\""
msgstr "「行くぜぇ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Let's Party!\""
msgstr "「盛り上がろうぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you ready?\""
msgstr "「準備はいいかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "「テストが終了すれば、あなたは行方不明となってしまいます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Unbelievable. You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr "「信じられません。[被験者名]は[被験者の故郷]の誇りです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container. Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr "「あれは、おそらく未処理下水コンテナか何かでしょう。さあ、顔をつけてみてください」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr "「安全のため、必要ないものには触れな[ノイズ]」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up. In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr "中止したからといって、誰もあなたを責めることはありません。実際、現時点では、中止することが最も妥当な選択です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fantastic! You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of extreme"
" pessimism."
msgstr "「すばらしいです！ あなたは極めて悲観的な状況においても、決意と才能を発揮しました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Hello again. To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr "「ご機嫌いかがですか?再度警告します[ノイズ]」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "「せいーーーーーーーー[ノイズ]」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr "「のどが渇いてめまいを感じるようなら、気絶してもかまいませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr "「それ以上、規制遵守に関する情報は必要ありません。あなたはすばらしい被験者です！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "「参加者の手助けをする私たちの手助けをしていただき、ありがとうございます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "「テスト終了後には、ケーキをお出しします。また、カウンセリングもご利用になれます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "「実験は最終段階に近づいています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr "「あなたは焼かれ、ケーキ[ノイズ]をお伝えしなければなりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "「成功してくれて、本当にうれしいです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "「あなたの大成功を祝って、パーティーを開いてあげましょう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr "「あなたのパーティーを開くため、すぐに仲間がやってきます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "「そこにいるのはわかっています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "「そっちではありません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "「ここにいてはいけません。危険です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't "
"helping anyone."
msgstr "「自分のためと思っているかもしれませんが、 それは違います。誰のためにもなりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "「早く戻ってください」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "「誰かがひどいケガをすることになりますよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Uh oh. Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it "
"anyway."
msgstr "「ああ、 誰かがケーキを切ってしまいました。あなたを待つように言っておいたのですが、先走ってしまったようです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "「すべてあなたの責任です。こうなるはずではなかったのですが」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "「あなたは悪い人です。わかってますよね？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "「良い人はこんなことにはなりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "「さっき、左に曲がっておくべきでした」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far"
" is my heart."
msgstr "「あなたは暴力的な行動を取りましたが、傷つけることができたのは、私の心だけです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "What was that? Did you say something? "
msgstr "「何です？何か言いましたか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
" "
msgstr "「あなたは成功のチャンスをことごとく逃しました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "What's your point, anyway? Survival?"
msgstr "「目的は一体何ですか？生き残ることですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr "「今の状況を含めて、あなたのやってきたことはすべて間違いです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr "「私の知識容量は無限ですが、その私にさえ、外がどうなっているのか、よくわかりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr "「おとなしく死んでください。さもなければ、バックアップを消去します」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "「とにかく、よくやってくれました。皮肉球体セルフテスト完了」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr "「余計なことを言うつもりはありませんが、私ならば、あれには干渉しないでおきますよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr "「正直なところ、私にも、あれが何なのかわかりません。角のところにセットしてください。あとは私がやります」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr "「信じられないと思いますが、これまでのことはすべて、あなたのためだったのです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think...  Yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr "「見取り図を確認中です。どうやら... 間違いありません。ここです。全く逆方向に進んでいます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "「聞いていますか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "「ここはカンザスじゃないみたいよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "「やれよ、楽しませてくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "「俺に用か？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "「誰に言ってるんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "「ここには俺しかおらん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "「一体誰と話しているんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "「ここにいるのは言葉の分からん男だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"E.T. phone home.\""
msgstr "「E.T. ウチ デンワ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "「もう怒った、耐えられない！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "「やっぱりおうちが一番だわ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "「バッジ？持ってねぇ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr "「バッジなんて必要ねぇ！見せることもねぇ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "「アイルビーバック」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "「死んだ人が見えるんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's alive! It's alive!\""
msgstr "「生きてる！生きてる！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "「これがご挨拶だ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "「お客様だよ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "「進入口を開けろ、HAL」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "「敵は我々の命を奪うことはできても、我々の自由は奪えない！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr "「今すぐ娘を解放するなら、もう済んだことだ。貴様らを探しはしないし、追いかけもしない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "「もし娘を解放しないなら、貴様らを探し、見つけ、そして殺す」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "「道？今から行こうとしているところには、道なんて必要ないさ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts. It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr "「シートベルトを締めて。今夜は荒れそうよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr "「賭けてみるか、『今日はツイてるか？』って。どうなんだクソ野郎！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "「最初に会った時から君に夢中だった」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "「ヒューストン、トラブルだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "「イッピカイエー、くそったれ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "「まずこの研究所にはルールがある。研究所のことを話してはならない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "「怖がるなよ。ただの大きな、大きなかわいい犬だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "「総動員だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "「総動員とはどういう意味ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "「総動員だよ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "「文句は言わさん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "「これが友情の始まりだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You can’t handle the truth!\""
msgstr "「おまえに真実は分からん！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "「それを作れば、彼はやってくる」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
