msgstr "調査から呼び戻す"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to a nearby forest to cut logs.\n"
" \n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: 1 \n"
"Effects:\n"
"> 50%% of trees/trunks at the forest position will be cut down.\n"
"> 100%% of total material will be brought back.\n"
