msgstr "睡眠不足で倒れました。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Anywhere would be a good place to sleep..."
msgstr "どんな場所でもぐっすり眠ってしまいそうだ..."

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You feel like you haven't slept in days."
msgstr "もう何日も寝ていない気がします。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You're too physically tired to stop yawning."
msgstr "身体がクタクタで欠伸が止まりません。"

